{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":74827926,"ns":0,"title":"Data center tiers","extract":"Data center tiers are defined levels of resiliency and redundancy for IT facility infrastructure. They are widely used in the data center, ISP and cloud computing industries as a framework for designing and classifying high availability systems.","description":"Defined levels of resiliency and redundancy for IT infrastructure","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}